  "follow_up": "The held-out-policy win (research question 5) and the strong category/context stability motivated Phase 11D: build an actual per-model calibrated policy pipeline (fingerprint -> profile -> policy) and compare it head-to-head against the shipped whole-cache adaptive policy, not just naive layouts. Source HEAD bb0b69a290c8de609bdce5494bb9b616972f39b9.",
